<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="http-checkfile">
  <title>Check a build report</title>
  <body>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='test {"testId":"http-checkfile","detectSteps":true}'/>
    <p>Write the build report to the <codeph>output</codeph> folder next to this page:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-shell">node -e "const fs=require('fs');fs.mkdirSync('output',{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync('output/report.txt','build 7 passed')"</codeblock>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"runShell":{"command":"node -e \"const fs=require(&apos;fs&apos;);fs.mkdirSync(&apos;output&apos;,{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync(&apos;output/report.txt&apos;,&apos;build 7 passed&apos;)\"","workingDirectory":"."}}'/>
    <p>Check that the <codeph>output</codeph> folder holds a text file.</p>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"checkFile":"output/*.txt"}'/>
    <p>Check that the report says the build passed.</p>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"checkFile":{"path":"output/report.txt","content":"/build [0-9]+ passed/","timeout":10000}}'/>
    <data name="doc-detective" value="test end"/>
  </body>
</topic>
